OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent action' needed to protect
OL,4,Alake
OL,5,
OL,6,FTourism, infrastructure challenges and
OL,7,F"outdated, undersized and poorly
OL,8,Fmaintained" wastewater systems are
OL,9,Fcontributing to the ecological decline
OL,10,Fof a popular lake, an environmental
OL,11,Fgroup has warned.
OL,13,FButtermere, in the Lake District, has
OL,14,Fseen rising nutrient levels in recent
OL,15,Fyears which can lead to excess
OL,16,Fphosphorus and blankets of algae.
OL,18,FA new report has found farming
OL,19,Fpractices alone "cannot account" for
OL,20,Fthe changes.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
