OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgent action' needed to protect
OL,4,Alake
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Cumbria Rivers Trust (WCRT), a
OL,7,Fcharity which tracked down the sources
OL,8,Fof phosphorus for the study, argues
OL,9,F"urgent regulatory action and
OL,10,Fmaintenance guidance are needed".
